{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生ドルでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MICHIさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/27/2058051/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"30分くらいしか一緒にいてないのに\n大好きになってしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/27/2058051/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人柄の良さが滲み出てて\n本当にお友達になりたい！！って思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田も共通の話題作りたいから\nフリースタイルダンジョンの方で攻めよう` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなみのりささん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/27/2058051/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"谷野愛美さん、岡山みのりさん、松前吏紗さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『アイドルお宝くじ』の連勝でもわかるように\nライブが素晴らしくて\n踊ってるのに綺麗なハーモニーで\nとても尊敬してたので\n今日生ドルに来ていただけて本当に嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/27/2058051/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コラボも嬉しかったな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/27/2058051/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/k